{
  "info": {
    "name": "Employee Office Geo-Location (ext-api)",
    "description": "Employee office selection with admin approval, and the approved-office location gate on /wow-attendance/verify.\n\nReference: docs/geo_location_api.md · SQL: sql/010_employee_geo_location.sql\n\nEvery request needs X-App-Id / X-App-Password (ExtAuthMiddleware) and `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from this service's POST /login. All endpoints are POST on fixed paths; ids go in the JSON body, list filters in the query string.\n\nSET THE VARIABLES FIRST (collection → Variables): base_url, app_id, app_password, admin_token (a user whose role is admin/superadmin), employee_token (an enrolled employee), employee_id (that employee's emp_id = the token's sub), office_id (a body code).\n\nSuggested run order: 1.1 → 2.1 → 2.2 → 3.1 → 3.2 → 2.3 → 4.1. `geo_location_office_id` and `selection_id` are filled in automatically by 1.1, 2.2 and 3.1.\n\nEnvelope: {\"status\": \"success\"|\"failed\", \"code\"?, \"message\", \"data\"}. Branch on `code`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Admin · Office geo-locations",
      "description": "Permission `attendance.geo.manage` (admin / superadmin). Use an admin's token in `admin_token`. Without the permission every call is 403 `FORBIDDEN`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Create office point",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP status is 201', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201]));",
                  "let j = {}; try { j = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "if (j.code) console.log('[' + pm.info.requestName + '] ' + j.code + ': ' + j.message);",
                  "if (j.status === 'success' && j.data && j.data.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('geo_location_office_id', j.data.id); console.log('saved geo_location_office_id=' + j.data.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-App-Id",
                "value": "{{app_id}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-App-Password",
                "value": "{{app_password}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/ext-api/geo-location/offices/create",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ext-api",
                "geo-location",
                "offices",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Adds a geo point to an office. `office_id` is the office BODY CODE (ictcell.body.body_code, e.g. 490010). radius_meters 30–1000 (default 100); status ACTIVE|INACTIVE (default ACTIVE); label optional (to tell several points of one office apart).\n\n201 → `data` = the point; its id is saved to `{{geo_location_office_id}}`.\nErrors: 400 INVALID_INPUT · 404 OFFICE_NOT_FOUND.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"office_id\": \"{{office_id}}\",\n  \"latitude\": 23.724032,\n  \"longitude\": 90.400358,\n  \"radius_meters\": 120,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"label\": \"Main building\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 List office points",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP status is 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "let j = {}; try { j = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "if (j.code) console.log('[' + pm.info.requestName + '] ' + j.code + ': ' + j.message);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-App-Id",
                "value": "{{app_id}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-App-Password",
                "value": "{{app_password}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/ext-api/geo-location/offices",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ext-api",
                "geo-location",
                "offices"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "office_id",
                  "value": "{{office_id}}",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "body code"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "ACTIVE",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "ACTIVE | INACTIVE"
                }
